# Management of Residents with Unstable Vital Signs – CRL

decision "Unstable Vital Signs – Triage":
- when "Resident Has Unstable Vital Signs" then:
  any:
  - when "Resident On Palliative Pathway" then use decision "Palliative Management".
  - when "Documented Choice To Remain In RACF" then use decision "Remain In RACF".
  - when "Documented Choice To Transfer To Hospital" then use decision "Transfer To Hospital".
  - when "No Documented Choice" then use decision "Transfer To Hospital".
- end when

decision "Palliative Management":
- when "Resident On Palliative Pathway" then:
  all:
  - recommend activity "Consult Usual Palliative Provider".
  - recommend activity "Apply Immediate Supportive Care".
  - when "Usual Palliative Provider Not Contactable Or Needs Specialist Support" then:
      any:
      - recommend activity "Contact HHS Specialist Palliative Care".
      - recommend activity "Contact PallConsult".
    - end when
  - recommend activity "Follow Condition-Specific Pathway".
- end when

decision "Remain In RACF":
- when "Documented Choice To Remain In RACF" then:
  all:
  - recommend activity "GP Review And Management Plan".
  - recommend activity "Apply Immediate Supportive Care".
  - recommend activity "Notify Substitute Decision Maker".
  - recommend activity "Consider HHS RaSS Or Specialist Support".
- end when

decision "Transfer To Hospital":
- when "Documented Choice To Transfer To Hospital" then:
  all:
  - recommend activity "Call QAS 000".
  - recommend activity "Notify GP".
  - recommend activity "Prepare Transfer Documentation".
  - recommend activity "Notify Substitute Decision Maker".
  - recommend activity "Notify HHS RaSS".
- end when
- when "No Documented Choice" then:
  all:
  - recommend activity "Call QAS 000".
  - recommend activity "Notify GP".
  - recommend activity "Prepare Transfer Documentation".
  - recommend activity "Notify Substitute Decision Maker".
  - recommend activity "Notify HHS RaSS".
- end when

decision "Assessment Of Unstable Resident":
- when "Resident Appears Unwell" then:
  all:
  - recommend activity "Use Appropriate PPE".
  - recommend activity "Primary Survey And Vital Signs".
  - recommend activity "Check Advance Directives".
  - when "Vital Signs Unstable" then use decision "Unstable Vital Signs – Triage".
  - when "Vital Signs Stable" then:
      all:
      - recommend activity "Take History And Look For Red Flags".
      - recommend activity "Re-check Vital Signs".
      - when "Vital Signs Become Unstable" then use decision "Unstable Vital Signs – Triage".
    - end when
- end when

activity "Use Appropriate PPE":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
- with `Ensure all staff wear appropriate personal protective equipment while assessing or managing the resident.`.

activity "Primary Survey And Vital Signs":
- request CPGCollectInformation.
- with `Perform primary survey; measure and document vital signs; identify red-flag values.`.

activity "Check Advance Directives":
- request CPGCollectInformation.
- with `Review resident’s chart and The Viewer for Advance Health Directive, Acute Resuscitation Plan, or Advance Care Plan.`.

activity "Apply Immediate Supportive Care":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
- with `Remain with resident; apply oxygen to maintain SpO₂ 92–96 % (88–92 % if COPD); position for comfort.`.

activity "Take History And Look For Red Flags":
- request CPGCollectInformation.
- with `Obtain history focusing on red-flag symptoms; seek collateral history if communication impaired.`.

activity "Re-check Vital Signs":
- request CPGCollectInformation.
- with `Repeat vital signs after history to detect changes.`.

activity "GP Review And Management Plan":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Contact resident’s GP or after-hours doctor to formulate management plan with resident or substitute decision maker.`.

activity "Consider HHS RaSS Or Specialist Support":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `At GP discretion, contact HHS RaSS or HHS specialist palliative care service for additional support.`.

activity "Call QAS 000":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Dial emergency services (QAS 000) for ambulance transfer to hospital.`.

activity "Notify GP":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Inform resident’s GP of deterioration if not already aware.`.

activity "Prepare Transfer Documentation":
- request CPGGenerateReport.
- with `Complete transfer paperwork and include Checklist for contact information.`.

activity "Notify Substitute Decision Maker":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Inform resident’s substitute health decision maker of situation and actions taken.`.

activity "Notify HHS RaSS":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Notify HHS RaSS of resident status and transfer.`.

activity "Consult Usual Palliative Provider":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Contact resident’s usual palliative care provider to determine management plan.`.

activity "Contact HHS Specialist Palliative Care":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Contact HHS specialist palliative care service for advice or review.`.

activity "Contact PallConsult":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Call PallConsult if HHS specialist palliative care service unavailable.`.

activity "Follow Condition-Specific Pathway":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
- with `Provide care according to relevant clinical pathway aligned with resident’s goals of care.`.

concept "Resident Appears Unwell":
- type is Condition.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from "Staff Observation Of Deterioration".

concept "Resident Has Unstable Vital Signs":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from "Vital Signs Unstable".

concept "Vital Signs Unstable":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from "Abnormal Vital Sign Measurements".

concept "Vital Signs Stable":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from (not "Vital Signs Unstable").

concept "Vital Signs Become Unstable":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from "Vital Signs Unstable".

concept "Documented Choice To Remain In RACF":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from "Advance Directive Indicates Stay".

concept "Documented Choice To Transfer To Hospital":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from "Advance Directive Indicates Transfer".

concept "No Documented Choice":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from (not ("Documented Choice To Remain In RACF" or "Documented Choice To Transfer To Hospital")).

concept "Resident On Palliative Pathway":
- type is Condition.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from "Palliative Pathway Flag".

concept "Usual Palliative Provider Not Contactable Or Needs Specialist Support":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- inferred from ("Palliative Provider Not Contactable" or "Specialist Support Indicated").
